#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"In the NPTL threading implementation, B<pthread_kill_other_threads_np>()  "
"exists, but does nothing.  (Nothing needs to be done, because the "
"implementation does the right thing during an B<execve>(2).)"
msgstr ""
"In der NPTL-Threading-Implementierung existiert zwar "
"B<pthread_kill_other_threads_np>(), aber diese Funktion macht nichts. (Es "
"muss nichts gemacht werden, da die Implementierung während eines "
"B<execve>(2) das richtige tut.)"

